%li.jpost#pdesign
  .title.expandable
    %a.more-details
      %i.fa.fa-plus
    %h3.name Product Designer

  .details
    .details-container
      %p.location
        San Francisco, CA or Singapore

      %p The Nitrous.IO product design team is obsessed with pixel perfection and always thinks there is room for improvement.  We are responsible for how things feel on the site, but that doesn't mean we're just designers-- we also write the code to implement our designs.

      %p We're looking for product designers who want to validate their assumptions by talking to customers, A/B testing and analyzing user metrics, but who also are confident with their design intuition.  Most importantly, you should be obsessed with shipping a perfect product and empathizing with our users.


      %h4 Responsibilities
      %p.reqs
        %ul
          %li Conceptualize, design, and implement interfaces for the Nitrous.IO web, desktop, and Chrome applications.
          %li Work with data team to analyze and validate design hypotheses.
          %li Adapt designs based on user experience testing and customer feedback
          %li Act as a "style ambassador" for the team, and mentor engineers on interface and usability decisions.
          %li Help establish the Nitrous.IO brand, where the canvas is blank and the brush is in your hand.
          %li Lead iterations on our logo, help design our offices, t-shirts, and more.

      %h4 Technologies
      %p You'll have worked with these or similar technologies:
      %p.reqs
        %ul
          %li Experience with Adobe Photoshop, Illustrator.
          %li Mastery of HTML, CSS
          %li Experience with SASS & Haml
          %li Some Javascript experience
          %li Some ruby, php, python or relevant scripting experience
          %li Some experience with git, svn or mercurial.

      %p.actions
        To apply, please send us the following:

        %p.reqs
          %ul
            %li Link to online portfolio or dribbble profile
            %li Link to applications you have designed
            %li Why you think cloud development is the future

      .details-actions
        %p
          = mail_to 'jobs@nitrous.io?subject=Product%20Designer', 'Apply for this Job', encode: 'javascript', class: "btn btn-success"

